            "G3 — Keep npm run check (typecheck plus 34 tests) green on main at every commit.",
            "G4 — Zero occurrences of an xkeysib- key in any audit line, error message or stderr output.",
            "G5 — Zero 429-driven tool failures under normal operation; throttling is absorbed by the limiter and the retry curve.",
